# EN: Unpacked alignments. The 106 the paper uses travel as data/alignments_used.tar.gz
#     and are unpacked on demand by R/04_build_trees.R.
# ES: Alineamientos descomprimidos. Los 106 que usa el paper viajan como
#     data/alignments_used.tar.gz y se descomprimen a demanda desde R/04_build_trees.R.
data/alignments/
outputs/runs/*.rds
!data/alignments/.gitkeep

# R session artefacts. The original project committed .RData and .Rhistory in
# three folders; they carry stale objects that silently shadow a fresh run.
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*~
